OL,3,GNEWSADriver who dragged head teacher to
OL,4,Ahis death jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver who dragged a head teacher to
OL,7,Fhis death for more than a mile under
OL,8,Fthe wheels of his car has been jailed
OL,9,Ffor life for murder.
OL,11,FSimon Richardson crashed into Michael
OL,12,FMullins in Warburton, Greater
OL,13,FManchester, on 20 April as cycled home
OL,14,Ffrom Stretford Grammar School in
OL,15,FTrafford.
OL,17,FJurors at Richardson's trial heard he
OL,18,Fthen stopped to try to dislodge the
OL,19,Finjured but still-living cyclist before
OL,20,Fdriving on with him still lodged
OL,21,Funderneath the vehicle.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
